          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What happens if I don't respond?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "148A no response: AO proceeds to issue 148 (non-response noted). 148 no return filed: best judgement assessment (S144). Reassessment queries ignored: additions without input. Non-response at every stage = worst possible outcome. Patron ensures timely response."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Reassessment vs regular scrutiny - what's the difference?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Scrutiny (143(3)): first detailed examination of filed return. Reassessment (147): second look at already processed/assessed return triggered by new information. Reassessment has additional safeguards (148A inquiry, specified authority approval). Patron represents in both."
